WEBVTT

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.690
I'm gonna catch a bunch!

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.420
All right! Me, too!

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.650
Oh, I found one!

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.780
What kind of shell is that?

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:14.740
A pond snail.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.160
Oh, so that's what a pond snail is?

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.560
I've never seen one before.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.450
Hey, there's a bunch over here!

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:23.190
All right! I got tons of fairy shrimp!

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.100
Those are so creepy.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.940
What are you doing, Ren-chan?

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.380
I'm gonna ambush them!

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:39.120
I got some tadpole shrimp!

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.060
It's a big haul.

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:19.490
<b>Episode 4</b>

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:19.490
<b>I Made a Teru-teru Bouzu</b>

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:34.100
Hotarun, do you like the tadpole shrimp?

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.210
I've never seen them before, 
so they're new to me.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:38.800
Tadpole Shrimp Duty 
Miyauchi Renge

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:38.800
I've never taken care of any before, either.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.650
Are we all going to alternate duty?

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:42.700
I'm on duty for them forever.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.850
You really like the tadpole shrimp, huh?

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:47.060
Man, it's still raining.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:50.570
What am I gonna do? I forgot my umbrella.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.730
Natsumi, let me share yours.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.650
Oh, fine.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:03:00.690
H-Hey, Senpai, would you like to share 
my umbrella as far as the bus stop?

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:03.940
Huh? Oh... Okay, if you don't mind.

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.390
Not at all! I'd love to share with you!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.300
I hope the rainy season ends soon.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:19.670
But rain is nice, too.

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:21.270
You think so?

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:23.510
Tomorrow's Sunday, though.

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.910
I hope it's sunny tomorrow.

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:26.510
Why's that?

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:28.140
My bike's coming!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:29.840
Oh, your parents bought you one?

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:31.890
My grandma sent it for me.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:34.730
It's a late gift to celebrate starting school.

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:36.220
That's great.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:39.890
Yeah! Now we can all go somewhere 
together on our bikes!

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.410
Don't try to ride by yourself just yet.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.480
Only ride when someone's with you.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.370
Okay!

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:54.890
Want to practice riding 
when the rain lets up?

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:56.460
Yes!

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:03.060
It won't stop raining.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.130
It's really coming down now.

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:12.450
I can't ride my bike in this.

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:29.650
Hey, Ren-chon. Is your teru-teru bouzu done?

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:30.540
It's done.

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:34.040
But it doesn't look quite like I imagined.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:38.040
If it's this small, the sun won't find it.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:41.300
You even take your teru-teru 
bouzu dolls seriously, huh?

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.880
I just had a great idea!

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:47.130
Nee-nee, do we have any paper plates?

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:49.810
I think there are some in the kitchen drawer.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.610
Here they are.

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:54.380
Here.

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:55.480
Thanks!

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:56.770
What are you going to do with it?

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:59.480
First, I'll cut holes in the plate...

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:02.440
Then I'll draw lines over 
the holes with a marker.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:05.540
Now I'll just put a rubber 
band through here...

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:09.590
Nee-nee, do we have that white 
raincoat you bought a while ago?

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:11.340
It's in the entryway.

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:13.160
Raincoat...

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.640
Mister Sun...

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:35.520
Yes! I'm the teru-teru bouzu!

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:37.930
Nee-nee, how does this look?

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:40.070
Oh, you look cute.

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:42.200
Can I go outside in this?

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.880
Huh? In that?

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:46.400
But it's raining. You probably shouldn't.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:50.770
I want to go outside and ask the 
sun itself to come out and shine.

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:54.910
It's a teru-teru bouzu's job 
to ask the sun to come out!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:59.000
All right, just stay here 
around the house, then.

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:01.700
Okay, I will!

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.840
Be careful.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:10.870
Frogs, frogs...

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:13.660
Frogs are grown-ups,

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:16.640
tadpoles are children.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.960
When they grow hind legs, they're moochers.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:23.480
When they grow front legs, 
they're in a rebellious stage.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.750
Frogs, frogs...

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:36.290
Oh, it's easier to dig on rainy days.

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:39.860
I'm gonna make a mountain, and a river.

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:50.630
Oh, no.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:53.580
I almost gave in to the 
temptation of the shovel.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:54.390
I know!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:57.140
If I use this shovel and pail to make noise,

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:00.350
it'll be easier for the sun to find me.

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:24.420
Mister Sun, Mister Sun! 
Please come out and shine!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.670
The rain still isn't stopping.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.810
Looks like this is going to be a long battle.

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:39.220
Oops, some black got on my raincoat...

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:43.350
But I still have to do my job.

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:48.400
Darn it...

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:52.200
I came to bring the manga Renge forgot 
at our house, and it started pouring.

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:54.790
I should've brought an umbrella.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:01.530
What's that noise?

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:31.140
Something made a noise. Was it Gu?

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:45.090
<i>Wh-What is that?!</i>

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:47.380
<i>Are those black tears and black drool?!</i>

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:51.340
<i>Is it a monster? Out in broad daylight?!</i>

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:54.290
<i>B-But even if it is a monster,</i>

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:57.870
<i>there are friendly monsters too, 
so maybe it'll let me go...</i>

00:08:58.340 --> 00:08:59.430
<i>Wait, what?</i>

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:02.840
<i>N-Nope! It's too far away to see clearly,</i>

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:04.390
<i>but it has some kind of weapon!</i>

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:06.640
<i>Wh-What do I do?!</i>

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:09.480
<i>If it has a weapon, 
it's obviously an evil monster!</i>

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:16.110
<i>I-I know. I can go to Renge's 
house and get Kazu-nee to help me.</i>

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.580
<i>Okay, wait for the right moment...</i>

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:20.490
<i>Now!</i>

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:25.870
It wasn't Gu. It was Koma-chan.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:30.460
Koma-chan, come pray for the 
sun to come out with me!

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:35.670
It's saying something and running 
after me with its weapon up?!

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:38.140
It's obviously hostile!

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:42.920
It's raining pretty hard now.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:45.890
I should go get Ren-chon.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:47.080
Oh, right...

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:49.400
I see it! Renge's house!

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:50.670
Kazu-nee!

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.860
Help! There's a monster out here!

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:10.030
H-H-Help me!

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:13.880
God! Buddha! Sun god!

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:25.030
Thank goodness it wasn't an evil monster.

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:26.380
Sorry about that.

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:31.100
I thought it'd make Ren-chon happy if I 
made myself into a teru-teru bouzu, too.

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.620
Koma-chan, you were so scared, you cried.

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:35.530
I wasn't crying! It was the rain!

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:37.640
The sun's out!

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:41.220
Oh, maybe the teru-teru bouzu worked.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.030
I'm gonna practice riding my bike!

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:44.530
I'll go with you.

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:06.390
Journal, journal, journal-nal.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:08.860
Time to eat.

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:21.690
Ren-chon, we're going home.

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:25.080
Hang on. I'm gonna write 
in the observation journal.

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:28.040
Oh, that's right. You're in 
charge of the tadpole shrimp.

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:30.620
How are they doing? Are they getting bigger?

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.340
They are!

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:34.500
This one eats lots of food.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.880
And this one swims really fast.

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:38.270
And that one...

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.710
Did you name them?

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:41.560
That's Flatty-san.

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:42.510
Which one?

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:43.750
All of them.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:45.370
I see.

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:53.100
Come on, you two, let's go. 
The bus is coming soon.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:54.860
We'll be right there!

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.280
Let's go.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:09.500
Another school day over...

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.350
The sun's finally out again.

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:13.410
It's because of the teru-teru bouzu.

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:15.880
Don't say that. 
Just remembering it freaks me out.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:17.430
What are you talking about?

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:19.220
This past Sunday,

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:22.920
Ren-chon was apparently out walking 
around dressed like a teru-teru bouzu.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:23.860
What?

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:25.760
I did my best to make the sun come out!

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.390
You did too well!

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.060
What should we do?

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.100
I wanna go to the candy store.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.840
I just got my allowance. Maybe I'll go, too.

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:35.900
Oh, can I come with you?

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.400
Let's go on our bikes.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.980
Oh, you can ride now?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:39.960
Yeah!

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.690
Good job!

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:44.800
That sound brings back memories.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:45.780
Yeah.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.890
Gimme candy!

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:48.900
Hi.

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:49.960
Hey.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:51.240
Hello.

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:52.620
Welcome.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:55.390
You made a teru-teru bouzu, too?

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:57.780
I had nothing else to do since it was raining.

00:12:57.780 --> 00:12:59.830
The rain stopped while 
I was making it, though.

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:01.300
What should I buy?

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:05.760
Those look good, too.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:14.700
Found some!

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.900
What?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:19.230
These are cute flowers.

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:21.890
They're called "hotarubukuro" (bellflowers).

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:23.260
Hotarubukuro...

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:25.060
They're Hotaru flowers!

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:26.200
Yeah!

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:32.890
Later.

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:34.150
See you tomorrow.

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:35.280
Bye-bye.

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:36.580
Bye!

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:28.140
Ren-chon, time for dinner.

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:29.780
Okay!

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:32.720
We went to the candy store today.

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.350
Swallow your food before you talk.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:52.070
<b>Grade 8 Class 1</b>

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:52.070
<b>+ Grade 1 
+ Grade 7 
+ Grade 9 
+ Grade 5</b>

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.240
I'm so tired!

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:55.010
I wish school started in the afternoon...

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:57.080
Quit pulling on my uniform.

00:14:58.180 --> 00:15:00.130
Hotaru, did you finish the homework?

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:01.210
I did.

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:03.410
Natsumi, did you do yours?

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:06.080
Wait, did I bring my homework?

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:12.590
Ren-chon, what's wrong?

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:18.560
Flatty-san isn't moving.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:26.480
Flatty-san

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:38.030
It's sad, but there's nothing we can do.

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:40.750
Tadpole shrimp don't live very long.

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.370
It's raining.

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:51.680
Renge, it's raining. Let's go back inside.

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:58.750
We'll clean up the tank later.

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:16.220
Okay, open your workbooks.

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:30.300
Another school day over.

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:32.730
And it's still raining.

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:07.440
Ren-chon, let's go!

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:13.510
Tomorrow's Sunday.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.130
Want to do something together again?

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.760
That sounds good. What should we do?

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:18.970
Hmm...

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:21.310
Ren-chon, what do you want to do?

00:17:22.760 --> 00:17:23.910
I...

00:17:26.630 --> 00:17:27.690
Oh, yeah!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.650
I forgot something!

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:31.360
The bus will be here soon!

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.570
I'll be right back!

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:37.950
Will Natsumi-senpai get back in time?

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:38.530
Dunno...

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:41.490
There's the bus.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:51.550
Um, I'm sorry, but one 
of us is running late.

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:53.420
Wait up, wait up!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.800
Made it!

00:17:57.110 --> 00:17:58.750
Ugh, I'm beat...

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.030
Be more careful, would you?

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:10.270
The field...

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:14.620
I know. If it's sunny tomorrow, 
why don't we go catch tadpole shrimp?

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:20.450
That's okay. I don't want them to die.

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:30.030
Well, then. I heard they built a convenience
store close by. Want to check it out?

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:31.210
That sounds good!

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.710
I think it's about a two-hour walk.

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.660
What?! Isn't that too far?

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:37.420
It's about normal, isn't it?

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:39.820
Renge, that okay with you?

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:41.760
Yes. Thank you.

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:43.840
Okay, tomorrow afternoon.

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:44.790
Sure.

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:45.970
Okay.

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.370
<b>Picture Diary</b>

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:12.290
Flatty-san died.

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:35.540
Man, that was awful.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:38.780
That trip to the convenience 
store yesterday was a nightmare.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:41.400
You're still talking about that?

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:42.740
That was too bad.

00:19:42.920 --> 00:19:46.020
I can't believe we went 
there and it was closed!

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:49.040
Well, I thought it'd be open 24/7!

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:55.250
Why is the tank still 
here after we cleaned it?

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:57.780
Oh, look a little closer.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:19:59.840
See anything?

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:07.850
Something's in it!

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:11.560
Looks like they did hatch.

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:16.520
See, I thought maybe the 
tadpole shrimp had laid eggs,

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:21.030
so I put in the dirt we used for 
them and put fresh water in.

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:24.990
They're Flatty-san?

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:27.620
That's right. They're Flatty-san.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:03.260
Nattsun, Nattsun!

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:06.490
Flatty-san was born!

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:13.200
There are so many Flatty-sans!

00:22:16.390 --> 00:22:21.520
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:42.240 --> 00:23:46.720
<i>Okay, we're all going 
to clean the pool today.</i>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>Episode 5</b>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>We Ate Okonomiyaki</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
<b>Non Non Biyori
Repeat</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
Photo: Tattsun

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
Please Watch Again
